{"schema_version": "exam-local-analysis-candidate-0.1", "candidate_id": "GK-SC-2013-Q012-LOCAL-ANALYSIS", "exam_id": "GK-SC-2013", "question_id": 12, "source_role": "answer_scoring_candidate", "candidate_status": "candidate_unverified", "candidate_kind": "answer_excerpt_from_local_analysis", "candidate_extraction_method": "local_analysis_answer_marker", "candidate_text": "因民之所利而利之/斯不亦惠而不费乎/择可劳而劳之/又谁怨/欲仁而得仁/又焉贪/君子无众寡/无小大/无敢慢/斯不亦泰而不骄乎", "candidate_text_sha256": "4fbc8e3569bb434ecf9e1a4f0d1c6e124fbfbf9a824617509fd39541e5021ee5", "analysis_excerpt": null, "analysis_excerpt_sha256": null, "source_authority_status": "unverified_local_provided", "answer_source_status": "missing_separate_answer_bundle", "scoring_status": "not_available_as_official", "mapping_level": "M0", "kp_id": "N/A", "source_analysis_segment": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2013/segments/analysis/Q012.md", "source_analysis_pdf": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/2013年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）.pdf", "source_analysis_mineru_md": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/mineru_result/2013年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）/full.md", "source_clean_md": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2013/clean_md/analysis.md", "source_segment_clean_sha256": "874a06d47e42f3ffe9f18814bf8ca826b634a1905e5f150fbfbdb0f729ca5b91", "source_segment_file_sha256": "2ff318f2195cb9095adcbb9e4d056f0ee9fe4858944376fe8d87a0ab94c4704e", "source_answer_bundle": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2013/answers/answer_bundle.md", "source_answer_index": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2013/answers/answer_index.jsonl", "review_status": "needs_manual_review", "notes": ["解析卷仅作为本地候选，不是独立答案或评分材料。", "原始解析段、题卷和 PDF 保持双链；不修改 source/prompt_text_raw。", "exact_excerpt_from_local_analysis_answer_marker", "candidate_unverified"]}
{"schema_version": "exam-local-analysis-candidate-0.1", "candidate_id": "GK-SC-2013-Q013-LOCAL-ANALYSIS", "exam_id": "GK-SC-2013", "question_id": 13, "source_role": "answer_scoring_candidate", "candidate_status": "candidate_mixed_analysis", "candidate_kind": "analysis_excerpt_without_explicit_answer_marker", "candidate_extraction_method": "raw_answer_field_unbounded", "candidate_text": "", "candidate_text_sha256": null, "analysis_excerpt": "为修辞手法的鉴赏上面，题干明确了颈联所用修辞手法为对比，考生无需概括，直接鉴赏就行，这样貌似降低了试题难度，但考生要挖掘出对比的层次也是有难度的。\n\n【学科网考点定位】本题考查“评价文章的思想内容和作者的观点态度”和“鉴赏文学作品的形象、语言和表达技巧”的能力。\n\n【解析】(1)这是一首和诗，从诗中华发、愁、壮心、醉、寒无睡等词语，可见诗人年岁已逝、忧愁苦闷、壮心不已等情感。鉴赏评价诗歌的思想感情要抓住诗中体现情感的意象。", "analysis_excerpt_sha256": "54e8b327f89b644ced6a003ede720505b43aa9e379a347064480409e4ff7f943", "source_authority_status": "unverified_local_provided", "answer_source_status": "missing_separate_answer_bundle", "scoring_status": "not_available_as_official", "mapping_level": "M0", "kp_id": "N/A", "source_analysis_segment": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2013/segments/analysis/Q013.md", "source_analysis_pdf": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/2013年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）.pdf", "source_analysis_mineru_md": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/mineru_result/2013年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）/full.md", "source_clean_md": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2013/clean_md/analysis.md", "source_segment_clean_sha256": "7f55a30541ff20e2e5d93746d130d8c4bee04b6daa09ed8c29aff16875494854", "source_segment_file_sha256": "40b2c01e314f69bf218c8e4cbc73a3fba757389ab2c4f7b9cffdb84759cc9ace", "source_answer_bundle": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2013/answers/answer_bundle.md", "source_answer_index": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2013/answers/answer_index.jsonl", "review_status": "needs_manual_review", "notes": ["解析卷仅作为本地候选，不是独立答案或评分材料。", "原始解析段、题卷和 PDF 保持双链；不修改 source/prompt_text_raw。", "no_explicit_answer_marker", "manual_boundary_required", "candidate_unverified", "manual_boundary_split", "题干与解析按源段中明确可见标记分离；未推断答案。"], "question_excerpt": "13.阅读下面的宋诗，回答问题。（8分）\n\n九日和韩魏公①\n\n苏洵\n\n晚岁登门最不才，萧萧华发映金罍②。\n不堪丞相延东阁，闲伴诸儒老曲台③。\n佳节久从愁里过，壮心偶傍醉中来。\n暮归冲雨寒无睡，自把新诗百遍开。\n\n【注】①九日：农历九月九日，即重阳节；韩魏公，即韩琦，时为丞相。②金罍：泛指酒盏。③曲台，指太常寺，掌礼乐郊庙社稷之事。\n\n（1）本诗主要表达了作者怎样的感情？结合全诗简要分析。（4分）\n\n（2）“佳节久从愁里过，壮心偶傍醉中来”在对比手法的运用上有何妙处？请简要赏析。（4分）", "question_excerpt_sha256": "13880df43e61450a46beaad84522850fc7c1f7f2cf61184b11e0b844174637d2", "manual_boundary": {"status": "split_on_explicit_source_marker", "marker": "为修辞手法的鉴赏上面，题干明确了颈联所用修辞手法为对比，", "original_mixed_excerpt_sha256": "7f55a30541ff20e2e5d93746d130d8c4bee04b6daa09ed8c29aff16875494854"}}
