{"schema_version": "exam-local-analysis-candidate-0.1", "candidate_id": "GK-SC-2013-Q016-LOCAL-ANALYSIS", "exam_id": "GK-SC-2013", "question_id": 16, "source_role": "answer_scoring_candidate", "candidate_status": "candidate_unverified", "candidate_kind": "answer_excerpt_from_local_analysis", "candidate_extraction_method": "local_analysis_answer_marker", "candidate_text": "①生动地刻画出胡杨林坚韧顽强的形象，增强文章的感染力；②深化主题，以胡杨树的生死暗示河流的变化，表现生命离开河流后的困顿；③由，河到树，由树到人，承上启下，结构更加严密。", "candidate_text_sha256": "47c932299b763710707438b73e02dc780a99029af213d6a22a861b0b4f2529cb", "analysis_excerpt": null, "analysis_excerpt_sha256": null, "source_authority_status": "unverified_local_provided", "answer_source_status": "missing_separate_answer_bundle", "scoring_status": "not_available_as_official", "mapping_level": "M0", "kp_id": "N/A", "source_analysis_segment": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2013/segments/analysis/Q016.md", "source_analysis_pdf": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/2013年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）.pdf", "source_analysis_mineru_md": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/mineru_result/2013年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）/full.md", "source_clean_md": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2013/clean_md/analysis.md", "source_segment_clean_sha256": "259b6c625259679481420991cbf8118ca226aeda91f195a7fa37a683d4658414", "source_segment_file_sha256": "2b79841a68735be01bf860731d3ef33eb609bc999630b7c6f8e7f811c4b83979", "source_answer_bundle": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2013/answers/answer_bundle.md", "source_answer_index": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2013/answers/answer_index.jsonl", "review_status": "needs_manual_review", "notes": ["解析卷仅作为本地候选，不是独立答案或评分材料。", "原始解析段、题卷和 PDF 保持双链；不修改 source/prompt_text_raw。", "exact_excerpt_from_local_analysis_answer_marker", "candidate_unverified"]}
{"schema_version": "exam-local-analysis-candidate-0.1", "candidate_id": "GK-SC-2013-Q017-LOCAL-ANALYSIS", "exam_id": "GK-SC-2013", "question_id": 17, "source_role": "answer_scoring_candidate", "candidate_status": "candidate_unverified", "candidate_kind": "answer_excerpt_from_local_analysis", "candidate_extraction_method": "local_analysis_answer_marker", "candidate_text": "①塔里木河身处沙漠，不得不与沙漠进行长期的坚韧的较量；②塔里木河给沙漠带来生命与文明，却不得不亲历文明的衰落；③塔里木河的奔腾与消失承载着人们的热爱、慌恐等复杂情感，引发了沉重的思考。", "candidate_text_sha256": "81eb40c7558965ee159cc8000e9443caf9bcdab79ac19acd6a0285b89aa46db9", "analysis_excerpt": null, "analysis_excerpt_sha256": null, "source_authority_status": "unverified_local_provided", "answer_source_status": "missing_separate_answer_bundle", "scoring_status": "not_available_as_official", "mapping_level": "M0", "kp_id": "N/A", "source_analysis_segment": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2013/segments/analysis/Q017.md", "source_analysis_pdf": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/2013年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）.pdf", "source_analysis_mineru_md": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/mineru_result/2013年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）/full.md", "source_clean_md": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2013/clean_md/analysis.md", "source_segment_clean_sha256": "52678f2799b59fe14f5db5114701204a528befa815fbc9a5dfa4e364f98ed15d", "source_segment_file_sha256": "faaa96b86b0650eac607e4134b07d19d5b3a00fa5738b9ca440bd8fa0df29a8c", "source_answer_bundle": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2013/answers/answer_bundle.md", "source_answer_index": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2013/answers/answer_index.jsonl", "review_status": "needs_manual_review", "notes": ["解析卷仅作为本地候选，不是独立答案或评分材料。", "原始解析段、题卷和 PDF 保持双链；不修改 source/prompt_text_raw。", "exact_excerpt_from_local_analysis_answer_marker", "candidate_unverified"]}
{"schema_version": "exam-local-analysis-candidate-0.1", "candidate_id": "GK-SC-2013-Q018-LOCAL-ANALYSIS", "exam_id": "GK-SC-2013", "question_id": 18, "source_role": "answer_scoring_candidate", "candidate_status": "candidate_unverified", "candidate_kind": "answer_excerpt_from_local_analysis", "candidate_extraction_method": "local_analysis_answer_marker", "candidate_text": "示例一\n\n河流是人类文化的源头。塔里木河曾赋予罗布泊人浪漫的生活气息，长江、黄河乃至家乡的每一条河，都滋养了中华民族源远流长的文化。如今地球上的很多河流正像塔里木河一样在萎缩，人类社会的发展不应以破坏自然为代价，否则将会给人类及其文化带来不可估量的损失。\n\n示例二\n\n河流县有超越自然生命的文化魅力。塔里不河的率直坦荡，既是自然属性的体现，也是文化人格的写照。在漫长的历史中，自然的河流也许会因为种种原因萎缩乃至消失，但我门依然可以丛现存的文化中感知河流的形态与历史，感悟河流的文化意义。", "candidate_text_sha256": "9127e2b0563c572639e06b60585472ca9c68c550234b27e70861d6cc5aa0b4ca", "analysis_excerpt": null, "analysis_excerpt_sha256": null, "source_authority_status": "unverified_local_provided", "answer_source_status": "missing_separate_answer_bundle", "scoring_status": "not_available_as_official", "mapping_level": "M0", "kp_id": "N/A", "source_analysis_segment": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2013/segments/analysis/Q018.md", "source_analysis_pdf": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/2013年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）.pdf", "source_analysis_mineru_md": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/mineru_result/2013年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）/full.md", "source_clean_md": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2013/clean_md/analysis.md", "source_segment_clean_sha256": "afe19412bca9da415c459e66a2e59c9c0bb88d1f44bb228ae4c0727e8159f6f4", "source_segment_file_sha256": "4016040a882fa45d9c82ac3e4c02d55ae9dc9533dd0370e8663ff3918b9f0b23", "source_answer_bundle": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2013/answers/answer_bundle.md", "source_answer_index": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2013/answers/answer_index.jsonl", "review_status": "needs_manual_review", "notes": ["解析卷仅作为本地候选，不是独立答案或评分材料。", "原始解析段、题卷和 PDF 保持双链；不修改 source/prompt_text_raw。", "exact_excerpt_from_local_analysis_answer_marker", "candidate_unverified"]}
