{"schema_version": "exam-local-analysis-candidate-0.1", "candidate_id": "GK-SC-2013-Q020-LOCAL-ANALYSIS", "exam_id": "GK-SC-2013", "question_id": 20, "source_role": "answer_scoring_candidate", "candidate_status": "candidate_unverified", "candidate_kind": "answer_excerpt_from_local_analysis", "candidate_extraction_method": "local_analysis_answer_marker", "candidate_text": "示例一\n\n曹雪芹家道巨变，却磨砺出傲岸的风骨；备受冷遇，却迸发出创作的激情；绳床瓦灶，却熔铸成生命的华章。“十年辛苦不寻常”终换成彪炳千秋的文学巨著，这难道不是苦难带给他的人生意义吗？\n\n示例二\n\n贝多芬童年不幸，却不曾破灭人生的梦想：恋人远离，却不曾消逝心中的激情：耳疾侵扰，去不曾消泯对音乐的执着。即使在最恶劣的境遇中，他也把痛苦转换为精神的欢乐。这不就是苦难带给他的人生意义吗？", "candidate_text_sha256": "32d0866fc41a17bb52c2d493a455553e17a9fb65a8098f25c8bd14c4ae55a8a4", "analysis_excerpt": null, "analysis_excerpt_sha256": null, "source_authority_status": "unverified_local_provided", "answer_source_status": "missing_separate_answer_bundle", "scoring_status": "not_available_as_official", "mapping_level": "M0", "kp_id": "N/A", "source_analysis_segment": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2013/segments/analysis/Q020.md", "source_analysis_pdf": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/2013年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）.pdf", "source_analysis_mineru_md": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/mineru_result/2013年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）/full.md", "source_clean_md": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2013/clean_md/analysis.md", "source_segment_clean_sha256": "43d6db90ecc8e927c8d18279c2e766b451ef60917728f15b948c518cd9bb98e2", "source_segment_file_sha256": "e950a2ca653ad2387af1bb80c8edd39363f0a493d63cfe049b3ddde7913e8798", "source_answer_bundle": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2013/answers/answer_bundle.md", "source_answer_index": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2013/answers/answer_index.jsonl", "review_status": "needs_manual_review", "notes": ["解析卷仅作为本地候选，不是独立答案或评分材料。", "原始解析段、题卷和 PDF 保持双链；不修改 source/prompt_text_raw。", "exact_excerpt_from_local_analysis_answer_marker", "candidate_unverified"]}
{"schema_version": "exam-local-analysis-candidate-0.1", "candidate_id": "GK-SC-2013-Q021-LOCAL-ANALYSIS", "exam_id": "GK-SC-2013", "question_id": 21, "source_role": "answer_scoring_candidate", "candidate_status": "candidate_mixed_analysis", "candidate_kind": "analysis_excerpt_without_explicit_answer_marker", "candidate_extraction_method": "raw_answer_field_unbounded", "candidate_text": "", "candidate_text_sha256": null, "analysis_excerpt": "只揭露社会阴暗面，愤世嫉俗，发牢骚，导致立意不高，甚至立意不当。\n\n一是 高考考生大多是成年学生，他们处在世界观的形成阶段，处在从学校的象牙塔走向广阔社会过度期。引导学生象。关注社会，关注生活，关注人性中美好的方面，关注人生价值，对社会现象有所思辨分析，正是命题人的立意所在。后者让考生有话可说而又不易出彩，是作文命题的最高境界。可以说，今年四川高考的作文命题达到了这样的境界。了社 【学科网考点定位】本题考查“写作”的能力。\n\n理普遍存在。", "analysis_excerpt_sha256": "322ccd04c09c7dd7960abb725b5fbfdc6855c90a64ad4378ed2129bc94253d08", "source_authority_status": "unverified_local_provided", "answer_source_status": "missing_separate_answer_bundle", "scoring_status": "not_available_as_official", "mapping_level": "M0", "kp_id": "N/A", "source_analysis_segment": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2013/segments/analysis/Q021.md", "source_analysis_pdf": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/2013年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）.pdf", "source_analysis_mineru_md": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/mineru_result/2013年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）/full.md", "source_clean_md": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2013/clean_md/analysis.md", "source_segment_clean_sha256": "737eeb4209e58198f5c33ef5e3155a0a1856086565c789d09604af497df8d147", "source_segment_file_sha256": "7def5c8add6bc5618fbbba0601980c5f4235a9b9950e46be552410bdbd91490f", "source_answer_bundle": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2013/answers/answer_bundle.md", "source_answer_index": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2013/answers/answer_index.jsonl", "review_status": "needs_manual_review", "notes": ["解析卷仅作为本地候选，不是独立答案或评分材料。", "原始解析段、题卷和 PDF 保持双链；不修改 source/prompt_text_raw。", "no_explicit_answer_marker", "manual_boundary_required", "candidate_unverified", "manual_boundary_split", "题干与解析按源段中明确可见标记分离；未推断答案。"], "question_excerpt": "## 21.作文（60分）\n\n阅读下面的文字，根据要求作文。\n\n有人说：过一种平衡的生活—学些东西，想些问题，做些事情，打打球，唱唱歌，画画画儿…针对这种说法，同学们展开了热烈的讨论。\n\n请根据以上材料，结合自己的体验与感悟，写一篇不少于800字的文章。要求：①题目自拟，立意自定，文体自选；②不得抄袭，不得套作；③用规范汉字书写。", "question_excerpt_sha256": "e916079e272a68295955207de656cfd1600afd87d95a6f4bbb61ff29bfb2521f", "manual_boundary": {"status": "split_on_explicit_source_marker", "marker": "只揭露社会阴暗面，愤世嫉俗，发牢骚，导致立意不高，甚至立意不当。", "original_mixed_excerpt_sha256": "737eeb4209e58198f5c33ef5e3155a0a1856086565c789d09604af497df8d147"}}
